---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/img/photos/elder-mountain-gorge.jpg" alt="" eleventy:widths="800,1600,2400" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 1600px, 100vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
  </div>
  <div class="hero-words">
    <h1 class="visually-hidden">Elder Mountain Volunteer Fire Department</h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">We volunteer our time to protect the lives and property of people living in and visiting the quiet mountain community of Elder Mountain, Tennessee.</p>
    <p class="hero-911">Call 911 for emergencies</p>
  </div>
  <a class="scroll-cue" href="#more" aria-label="Scroll down to read more">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="36" height="36" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 9l7 7 7-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
  </a>
</section>

<div class="over-hero" id="more">
<section class="response">
  <figure class="response-photo">
    <img src="/img/photos/engine-1-pump-panel.jpg" alt="Side of the engine showing the Elder Mountain Fire Rescue shield and the pump panel" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw">
  </figure>
  <div class="response-text">
    <h2>Rapid, all&#8209;hazard response</h2>
    <p>We provide an all-hazard response to the residents of Elder Mountain and mutual aid to our neighboring departments.</p>
    <ul class="calls">
      <li>Structural, vehicle, and wildland fires</li>
      <li>Rescues and vehicle accidents</li>
      <li>Medical emergencies</li>
      <li>Other hazards</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="join">
  <div class="join-inner">
    <figure class="join-photo">
      <img src="/img/photos/lz-training-group.jpg" alt="Volunteers standing in front of a LifeForce medical helicopter in a field" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 55vw, 100vw">
    </figure>
    <div class="join-text">
      <h2>Want to volunteer to help your community?</h2>
      <p>About 20 volunteers serve as firefighters, emergency medical technicians, medical first responders, and support staff, all trained or in training. We are always accepting applications for firefighters and support members.</p>
      <p><a class="button" href="/contact/?topic=join">Apply to volunteer</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="recent">
  <div class="recent-head">
    <h2>Training and calls</h2>
    <a class="text-link" href="/photo-gallery/">See all photos</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="mosaic">
  {%- for p in gallery %}{% if p.home %}
    <li><a href="/photo-gallery/#{{ p.file | replace('.jpg', '') }}"><img src="/img/photos/{{ p.file }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw"></a></li>
  {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
</div>
